---
interface Props {
  title?: string;
  description?: string;
  imageSrc?: string;
  imageAlt?: string;
  features?: { icon: string; title: string; description: string }[];
}

const {
  title = "Medicina del Futuro, Hoy",
  description = "En Dharma, no solo tratamos síntomas; reprogramamos tu bienestar. Somos pioneros en Medicina Bioregenerativa y Epigenética, disciplinas que permiten restaurar tejidos y funciones deterioradas usando los propios recursos de tu organismo.",
  imageSrc = "/MEDIC.jpg",
  imageAlt = "Laboratorio Bioregenerativo Dharma",
  features = [
    { icon: "fa-dna", title: "Medicina Celular", description: "Terapias con células madre y factores de crecimiento autólogos." },
    { icon: "fa-fingerprint", title: "Epigenética", description: "Análisis de factores externos para optimizar tu longevidad." },
    { icon: "fa-leaf", title: "Enfoque Natural", description: "Tratamientos bio-compatibles potenciados con ozonoterapia." },
    { icon: "fa-shield-alt", title: "No Invasivo", description: "Recuperación inmediata sin cirugías ni riesgos químicos." },
  ],
} = Astro.props;
---

<section id="acerca" class="py-25 bg-white relative overflow-hidden" data-aos="fade-up">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5">
    <div class="text-center mb-16" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
     <span class="inline-block bg-linear-to-r from-amber-700 to-amber-500 text-white px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase mb-5"
          ><i class="fas fa-star mr-2"></i> Sobre Dharma</span>
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif text-slate-900 mb-4">{title}</h2>
      <div class="h-1 w-20 bg-linear-to-r from-amber-500 to-amber-200 mx-auto rounded-full"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
      <div class="relative order-2 lg:order-1" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
        <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-slate-100 rounded-[2.5rem] -rotate-2"></div>
        <div class="relative h-125 w-full rounded-4xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-amber-100 bg-slate-200">
          <img
            src={imageSrc}
            alt={imageAlt}
            class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-105"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-slate-900/40 to-transparent"></div>
          <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6 p-6 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl border border-white/50">
            <p class="text-slate-800 text-sm font-medium italic">
              "Transformamos tu salud optimizando la expresión de tus genes y restaurando tu vitalidad celular."
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="order-1 lg:order-2 space-y-8" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-xl leading-relaxed font-light">
            {description}
          </p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed">
            Bajo la dirección de la Dra. Amalia Luque, aplicamos protocolos de <span class="font-semibold text-slate-800">clase mundial</span> (Rusia, EE.UU. y España) que combinan la biotecnología avanzada con terapias integrativas para lograr resultados extraordinarios sin recurrir a procedimientos invasivos.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 pt-4">
          {features.map((feature, index) => (
            <div class={`group flex items-start gap-4 ${index < 2 ? 'data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="' + ((index + 1) * 100) + '"' : ''}`}>
              <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-amber-50 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-amber-600 border border-amber-100 transition-colors group-hover:bg-amber-500 group-hover:text-white">
                <i class={`fas ${feature.icon}`}></i>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">{feature.title}</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs leading-relaxed">{feature.description}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>